     1→/**
     2→ * ContentCard — main orchestrator
     3→ *
     4→ * Resolves the effective QR type and renders the correct per-type card.
     5→ * All parsing lives in ./parsers/, all card UI in ./cards/, shared atoms in ./shared/.
     6→ *
